#: input/pagecontent/system-actors.md:2
msgid "Actors"
msgstr "参与者"

#: input/pagecontent/system-actors.md:6
msgid "Actors produce, manage, or act on health information. Actors relevant to the SMART Trust Network are as follows."
msgstr "参与者生成、管理健康信息或据其采取行动。与 SMART 信任网络相关的参与者如下。"

#: input/pagecontent/system-actors.md:19
msgid "Business Rules Library"
msgstr "业务规则库"

#: input/pagecontent/system-actors.md:22
msgid "Product Catalogue"
msgstr "产品目录"

#: input/pagecontent/system-actors.md:25
msgid "Terminology Service"
msgstr "术语服务"

#: input/pagecontent/system-actors.md:20
msgid "Trusted service, provided by a node within a trust network, to share business rules using Clinical Quality Language (CQL) specification."
msgstr "由信任网络内的某一节点提供的可信服务，用于按照临床质量语言（CQL）规范共享业务规则。"

#: input/pagecontent/system-actors.md:26
msgid "Used to manage and publish mappings between various local code systems and required vocabularies that are utilized Verifiable Digital Health Certificates."
msgstr "用于管理和发布各种本地代码系统与可验证数字健康证书所使用的必需词汇表之间的映射。"

#: input/pagecontent/system-actors.md:23
msgid "Used to manage and publish product master data for health products, devices and commodities that may be referenced in a Verifiable Digital Health Certificates."
msgstr "用于管理和发布可验证数字健康证书中可能引用的卫生产品、器械和商品的产品主数据。"
